                    "The mechanism is simple once you see it, and you have almost certainly watched it happen without being able to name it.  Somebody asks an assistant what to buy, gets your brand recommended, and then does what people do: they type your brand name into a search box, or go straight to your site.  Your analytics sees a search visit or a direct visit.  The thing that caused it is invisible.  More than nine in ten of those visits get filed under something other than the cause.",
